[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11161.51, "timestamp": "03:06:01", "text": "是的，这是可见音频。我们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11169.91, "timestamp": "03:06:09", "text": "我不知道正确的方法是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11177.59, "timestamp": "03:06:17", "text": "想象一下，如果我不小心那样倾斜了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11180.309, "timestamp": "03:06:20", "text": "把它靠在水族箱上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11194.389, "timestamp": "03:06:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11197.75, "timestamp": "03:06:37", "text": "我认为这个职位不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11201.429, "timestamp": "03:06:41", "text": "但如果他飞走了，那会是好事吗？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11205.15, "timestamp": "03:06:45", "text": "意思是呃，它要消失了。"}]